1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,860
Alex: The supposed secret document was fake. And partly copied.

2
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:12,480
Maya: It’s called The Protocols of the Elders of Zion. First published in nineteen-oh-three, it pretended to reveal secret Jewish plans.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:21,930
Alex: But those meeting records were invented. And here’s the giveaway: large sections came from an earlier French political satire that wasn’t even about Jewish people.

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:34,080
Maya: In nineteen-twenty-one, The Times of London exposed the copying. The United States Holocaust Memorial Museum documents the forgery and how it kept spreading afterward.

5
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:46,020
Alex: So this wasn’t a hidden truth finally uncovered. It was a fabricated accusation dressed up as an insider document. A dramatic cover didn’t make it evidence.

6
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:53,980
Maya: That matters when a post recycles the same story with new graphics. New packaging doesn’t repair false evidence.

7
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:58,440
Alex: An old lie doesn’t become true in high definition.

